    "body": "I see the same - Windows 10 21H2 (OS Build 19044.2130)\r\n\r\n```\r\nnu > starship --version\r\nstarship 1.11.0\r\nbranch:master\r\ncommit_hash:\r\nbuild_time:2022-10-15 01:51:42 +00:00\r\nbuild_env:rustc 1.64.0 (a55dd71d5 2022-09-19),stable-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc\r\n```\r\n\r\nI tested in: \r\n\r\n- Windows Terminal 1.15.2874.0\r\n- Windows Terminal Preview 1.16.2641.0\r\n- cmd.exe\r\n- ConEmu 220807\r\n\r\nThe problem only seems to be apparent in Windows Terminal (1.15 and 1.16). Both cmd.exe and ConEmu seem fine.\r\n\r\nI tried enabling the **Redraw entire screen** and **Use software rendering** settings, but that made no difference. Also tried disabling Atlas Engine and that made no difference either.",
