    "updated_at": "2022-10-22T18:05:25Z",
    "body": "I'm unsure if it's the same issue I was facing, but going into config.nu and setting shell_integration to false instead of true under \r\nlet-env config fixed flickering in the terminal for me, albeit I'm using WSL so maybe it isn't the same problem.\r\n\r\nAlso I originally only got this issue with nushell + starship but after a while it appeared using only nushell without starship, so it might be an issue on nushells end",
