    "body": "Is this still an issue? I don't have `shell_integration` changed and I don't have the issue. It's also not a bool.\r\n\r\n```\r\nnu ❯ $env.config.shell_integration\r\n╭────────────────────────┬───────╮\r\n│ osc2                   │ true  │\r\n│ osc7                   │ true  │\r\n│ osc8                   │ true  │\r\n│ osc9_9                 │ false │\r\n│ osc133                 │ true  │\r\n│ osc633                 │ true  │\r\n│ reset_application_mode │ true  │\r\n╰────────────────────────┴───────╯\r\n```\r\n\r\nI don't have a standard starship config though.",
